From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:52:33 +1100
Subject: fix: running from a wild Pokemon wins over trapping abilities on
 Little and Junior

alwaysRunAway now also skips IsRunningFromBattleImpossible in wild battles, so
Arena Trap, Shadow Tag and Magnet Pull no longer stop RUN (QA-05).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNqSDphYuD2Aqe9TExdQMP

diff --git a/src/battle_main.c b/src/battle_main.c
index d2b9b12e2..cd9171fee 100644
--- a/src/battle_main.c
+++ b/src/battle_main.c
@@ -3029,6 +3029,12 @@ u8 IsRunningFromBattleImpossible(void)
     u8 side;
     s32 i;
 
+    // Little Trainers: running from a wild Pokemon never fails, so Arena Trap, Shadow Tag, Magnet
+    // Pull and trapping moves do not stop it either (TryRunFromBattle then always succeeds).
+    if (LT_BattleRulesActive() && LT_Rules()->alwaysRunAway && !(gBattleTypeFlags & BATTLE_TYPE_TRAINER)
+     && GetBattlerSide(gActiveBattler) == B_SIDE_PLAYER)
+        return BATTLE_RUN_SUCCESS;
+
     if (gBattleMons[gActiveBattler].item == ITEM_ENIGMA_BERRY)
         holdEffect = gEnigmaBerries[gActiveBattler].holdEffect;
     else
